A quote after a caption starts fresh

```
> - t
^ p
>   # h
l
.
<figure>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>t</li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
  <figcaption>p</figcaption>
</figure>
<blockquote>
  <h1 id="h">h</h1>
</blockquote>
<p>l</p>
```

